      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-01-23_WidnesExaminer_art0209" n="art0209">
        <p>SALES BY AUCTION</p>
        <p>HENRY TAYLOR, AUCTIONEER AND VALUER. ESTATE &amp; INSURANCE AGENT„ 15. PoLD-STREET, WARRINGTON</p>
        <p>Tel. 228</p>
